        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "jw0bj03",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "5.Town Planning"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z5advr5",
      "content": "• Cities were divided into Citadel and Lower Town"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ybvtfdc",
      "content": "• Houses were made of baked bricks"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "73hr40b",
      "content": "• Roads intersected at right angles"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "83p1dnr",
      "content": "• Covered drainage system was highly advanced"
    },
    {
      "id": "hiioxvq",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "6.Economy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h7qic38",
      "content": "• Agriculture was the main occupation"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oyz401d",
      "content": "• Wheat and barley were major crops"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "q2m2vxy",
      "content": "• Trade existed with Mesopotamia"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1qrcjhc",
      "content": "• Standard weights and measures were used"
    },
    {
      "id": "qw2yoj3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "7.Religion"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "gz5bow8",
      "content": "• Worship of Mother Goddess"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0u9p745",
      "content": "• Pashupati seal suggests proto‑Shiva worship                                                     "
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7aqlwxf",
      "content": "• Sacred animals included bull and unicorn"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "194sf66",
      "content": "• Peepal tree considered sacred"
    },
    {
      "id": "qum5flz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "8.Decline of the Indus Valley Civilization"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nk3rb8b",
      "content": "• Climate change and drying of rivers"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "pws7021",
      "content": "• Floods and natural disasters"
    },
    {
